{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3001_003mik", "source_sha256": "a7577f26f370a380a4bd173bf2d64be77ba4ac0462518093d3bd4be29a471b48", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょうどよかったの！\nミキの相談にのってくれる？", "zh": "{$P$}，你来得正好！\n美希可以找你商量事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3002_p", "source_sha256": "5dd874552cd3557c2e04aa7522313087bb761667240bf97e1c842ef188c3e407", "ja": "美希が、俺に相談……？\nいったい、何があったんだ？", "zh": "美希来找我商量……？\n到底是发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3003_003mik", "source_sha256": "ded0d3b8e2e192ed46b3e4c2702d4087150aa42ce66c8ed1bd364900c4a56956", "ja": "あのね、ミキ、\nさっきからずーっと悩んでて……。", "zh": "跟你说，美希，\n从刚才就一～～直很烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3004_003mik", "source_sha256": "cca87a43c52aaa83c3a855e836774a9f4583f0f81e1bc77b4bb81601aeb0f9cc", "ja": "ツナマとメンタ、どっちがいいと思う？", "zh": "鲔沙和明太你觉得哪个好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3005_p", "source_sha256": "7a09fdfea2caf175cb66065cd697405d0e09800c41edf19bddfe971182345cd0", "ja": "ツナ、マ……。ごめん、なんだって？", "zh": "鲔、沙……抱歉，你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3006_003mik", "source_sha256": "416c5620ab62d7a87af2435b0a59cd659f66610f2b2c4b3f2206a1d2f4e8965a", "ja": "むー、マジメに聞いてなのっ。\n今度は、ちゃんと聞いてね？", "zh": "唔～你要认真听唷！\n这次要听清楚啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3007_003mik", "source_sha256": "92089b754a679c5f077dafa960ac1eda79ab31b651b50f50f29d269b451e90b1", "ja": "{$P$}は、ツナマヨと明太子だったら\nどっちのおにぎりが好き？", "zh": "如果是鲔鱼沙拉和明太子，{$P$}\n喜欢哪一种馅料的饭团？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3008_003mik", "source_sha256": "9ebee851e518874729bca91e467b65a0d1640c13e58f074995d4e98cbf3d2802", "ja": "ホントはどっちも食べたいけど、ミキ、\nこのあと収録だから、二つともはムリなの。", "zh": "其实美希两种都想吃，可是，\n美希等一下就要录影了，不能吃两个饭团唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3009_003mik", "source_sha256": "254d44c2eae8ad6d531c5d6f56d06af48fa3b13bdbf221068c494b6d0b7fbb78", "ja": "だからー、ミキがどっちを食べるか、\n{$P$}が決めていいよ☆", "zh": "所以～美希到底要吃哪一种，\n就由{$P$}决定吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3010_p", "source_sha256": "3ae5be4021119d1172beeda5d2aacc14e37d79525de4ba9688b8b554a9ecaaf6", "ja": "どうしてシャケじゃないのを……いや、まあいい。\nだったら、今日はレギュラー番組の仕事だから……", "zh": "为什么不选鲑鱼……算了，这不是重点。\n既然这样，今天是常态节目的工作，所以就选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3011", "source_sha256": "9077dc296ffc1db94060045fcde1ec1351092c92751a829aae8b843301830ee9", "ja": "ツナマヨおにぎり", "zh": "鲔鱼沙拉饭团", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3012", "source_sha256": "06fcd694c813592ef6762a74495d5feef35b525b3ab028cef15c10bde1ec07dc", "ja": "明太子おにぎり", "zh": "明太子饭团", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3200_p", "source_sha256": "19ae6b86c7504169c702640ed7c3ba89af4d328649a6931e03ee59e384a9c10c", "ja": "ツナマヨがいいんじゃないか？\n定番レギュラーの仕事には、定番の味ってことで。", "zh": "鲔鱼沙拉饭团比较好吧？\n配合经典的常态节目，选择经典的口味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3201_003mik", "source_sha256": "d671df1160a36ab610eead3276650e679d4c01603fb89547d1847f41c701e546", "ja": "そっか！　よくわかんないけどミキ、そう言われると、\nすっごくツナマヨの気分になってきたかも！", "zh": "是喔！美希不是很懂，可是听你这样一说，\n美希好像就变得非常想吃鲔鱼沙拉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3202_003mik", "source_sha256": "9cef286a4d33fdaf85cffd7bad5cef425f9b9c6b8ef2426cc3ac290e6ef3efb2", "ja": "それに{$P$}が選んでくれたんだし、\nきっとおいしいよね☆　じゃあ、いただきますなの～♪", "zh": "而且是{$P$}替美希选的，\n一定会很好吃☆那美希开动了唷～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3300_p", "source_sha256": "19ae6b86c7504169c702640ed7c3ba89af4d328649a6931e03ee59e384a9c10c", "ja": "ツナマヨがいいんじゃないか？\n定番レギュラーの仕事には、定番の味ってことで。", "zh": "鲔鱼沙拉饭团比较好吧？\n配合经典的常态节目，选择经典的口味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3301_003mik", "source_sha256": "adcefb7a0f77618b5c8f5753b92b4ac1548cbc71f1b786f91d278531d420a13c", "ja": "そっか！　言われてみればその通りってカンジ！\nずっと悩んでたから、ミキ、すっきりしたの☆", "zh": "对喔！美希听你这样一说，就有说得没错的感觉！\n美希一直很烦恼，现在畅快多了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3302_003mik", "source_sha256": "78575820aafa25057cf0d5bf348b442215227cce6bb04dcb1f2d3c694b82f0a3", "ja": "あふぅ……。ほっとしたらミキ、眠くなってきたかも。\nツナマヨ……ミキ……マヨ……むにゃむにゃ……。", "zh": "啊呼……一放松下来，美希好像就困了。\n鲔鱼沙拉……美希……沙拉……呼……呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3500_p", "source_sha256": "4838d990f9a035bf9d2a0cad356f315b242d04d98ec2bb1c431c2d4257f2aa3e", "ja": "明太子がいいんじゃないか？\nレギュラーの仕事に、ピリッと変化を入れてみよう。", "zh": "明太子饭团比较好吧？\n试着给常态性的工作加入带点刺激的变化吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3501_003mik", "source_sha256": "6998a8e9f08f9f42e3cec5f257a631914cfaaa0cf814786368aa7cf562039eaa", "ja": "あはっ、やっぱり？　ミキも明太子の\nピリッとした感じ、けっこう好きだし☆", "zh": "啊哈，果然是这样？美希也觉得明太子\n很有刺激感，所以满喜欢的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3502_003mik", "source_sha256": "988c0718d043fbc9c35f0586caa962ee6c7ec414256216d79dcbf38535b74c76", "ja": "{$P$}も、ピリッてしたい？\nじゃ、ひと口だけね。……はい、あーん、して？", "zh": "{$P$}要不要也来刺激一下？\n那就分你一口……来，把嘴巴张开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3600_p", "source_sha256": "4838d990f9a035bf9d2a0cad356f315b242d04d98ec2bb1c431c2d4257f2aa3e", "ja": "明太子がいいんじゃないか？\nレギュラーの仕事に、ピリッと変化を入れてみよう。", "zh": "明太子饭团比较好吧？\n试着给常态性的工作加入带点刺激的变化吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3601_003mik", "source_sha256": "850adb827ec29b0e6f65eec968fa6b6f87d18b1b779b341bac3fd93c1d9a5d6d", "ja": "ふーん。じゃ、明太子にするね。\nツナマヨは、{$P$}が持ってて？", "zh": "嗯～那就选明太子啰。\n{$P$}，帮我拿着鲔鱼沙拉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_3602_003mik", "source_sha256": "a218bc23112ff5086ed88bc582aa3bcbfd112e3c57bd2063fd6f4f3fe83c3d48", "ja": "収録が終わったら食べるからー、\nそれまで、ミキのおにぎり守っててねっ。", "zh": "等录影结束后，美希再吃～\n在那之前，要保护好美希的饭团喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
